# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: ClawsMail.
Package: ClawsMail
Section: Mail
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: arm32, vfpv3
Depends: SharedUnixLibrary (>= 1.16), ARMEABISupport, Iconv
Recommends: TTF-Noto-Color-Emoji
Components: Apps.Network.!ClawsMail (Movable LookAt)
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-gtk
Description: Claws Mail email client (GTK 3)
 An email client with POP3, IMAP and SMTP, all with TLS through
 AcornSSL (RISC OS 5.28 or later), and local MH folders. HTML mail is
 laid out, and links open in your browser. Starts on the icon bar.
 .
 This is a public beta of the riscos-gtk ports.
Build-Map: !ClawsMail -> Apps/Network/!ClawsMail
Build-Notice: Claws Mail, packaged for PackMan from the riscos-gtk release zip on
 https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-gtk/releases
 .
 Claws Mail is Claws Mail 4.4.0 (www.claws-mail.org), under the GNU GPL version 3 or later. It is linked with GTK 3 and its
 libraries (LGPL) and includes DejaVu fonts and PThreadTicker. The
 source is offered by the Source file in the application and on the
 release page. Licences follow.
